From 3d8e8db55fda6e6942551f1562865555d053a7c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:11:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: backport nine upstream fixes after 7.2

Fixes from mainline and ath-next that the backports-7.2 tree and
OpenWrt main do not carry yet, for the radios of the Arista APs:

mac80211 and cfg80211 (patches/subsys):
 485 3412e9a80078 keep paired old chanctx alive
 486 437f3727b4fd count only matching reservations in reserved switch
     (both: use-after-free when an in-place channel context
     reservation with several BSSes on a radio, a CSA, frees the old
     context early)
 487 67a9e80c3ca2 drain PS delivery work during station teardown
 488 e588e83e5c7a shut down RX BA session timer on teardown
     (both: use-after-free while an AP removes a station)
 489 5e4f3509793b drop oversized fragments to avoid extra_len overflow
     (a peer can panic the kernel where mac80211 defragments, the
     ath10k-ct radios)
 490 9eda41e32263 fix RTS threshold setting for single-radio PHY
     (the RTS threshold was never written on ath11k and ath10k phys)

ath11k (patches/ath11k):
 985 e56c9d429ba0 fix unbalanced IRQ enable/disable during
     suspend/resume (fixes f7a74e131d3f, OpenWrt's 951; base for the
     AHB recovery series pending on the list)
 986 9e15ccad0877 reject short management RX frames
 987 8ab38bbac022 fix resource leak on error in ext IRQ setup

All nine apply after the port's inner patches (a mac80211 prepare
with 0001-0106). Bump PKG_RELEASE.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
